{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120879","id":3984154284,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7teV6s","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120879","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120879.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120879.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120879","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120879/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120879/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120879/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/38a0e16db094fb96703480fe49581828df389f50","number":120879,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Consolidate toggle buttons into one base class","user":{"login":"MileyHollenberg","id":799917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5OTkxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/799917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/MileyHollenberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MileyHollenberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe `CheckButton` was a near carbon copy of the `CheckBox` class (only really changing the default alignment of the button icon itself) and the `CheckBox` was simultaneously used for a `RadioButton` rather than the two being seen as independent buttons. This PR consolidates the code into a single `ToggleButton` base class and creates the `CheckButton`, `CheckBox` and `RadioButton` as child classes of it which all have slightly different default themes and their own icons.\r\n\r\nThese buttons now also support more styling options similar to #120766. I choice to consolidate these three button types to avoid triple duplicating the code but that does mean that this will be a breaking change.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I added a new theme constant `button_on_right` to align the button on either the left or right side. By default these are on the left side with the exception of the `CheckButton` where it defaults to `1` so it aligns to the right side. When the layout mode is set to 'right to left' they still switch sides accordingly.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/836f3810-cc2d-456e-b2b3-f89cefb603a8\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n\r\n* When a `CheckBox` has a `ButtonGroup` assigned, it will still behave accordingly but will no longer automatically visually become a radio button. Instead the `RadioButton` class must be used to get the default styling (the `ProjectDialog` options for the renderer have been updated, all other places where a button group was used seem to be for flat buttons instead and thus wouldn't have the radio button styling to begin with).\r\n* The `radio_checked`, `radio_unchecked`, `radio_checked_disabled` and `radio_unchecked_disabled` theme options for the `CheckBox` have been removed and you should instead use `checked`, `unchecked`, `checked_disabled`, `unchecked_disabled` on any of the `ToggleButton` child classes.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWhilst it might look like a big PR, the majority of the changes are in updating the include statement for the new toggle_button header file. The real meat of this PR lies in `ToggleButton` class along with the default theme updates and documentation.\r\n\r\nI looked at the `Slider` and `HSlider`/`VSlider` classes for reference on how to do this as it's a very similar usecase.\r\n\r\nThe new `RadioButton` icon is simply the `GuiRadioChecked` svg with the color changed to the same green color as the other control items. The `ToggleButton` is simply the same as the `CheckBox` icon\r\n\r\nHere's a test project to see the new styling options in action: [guitest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29603667/guitest.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"